Output a structured diagnostic report before implementation.

==================================================
7. PHASE 2 — MULTI-TENANT FOUNDATION
==================================================

Implement multi-tenancy first.

Required data model additions:
- Tenant
- TenantDomain or domain mapping support
- tenantId linkage in all tenant-owned records

At minimum, design these models/entities:

Tenant:
- id
- name
- slug
- subdomain
- customDomain
- status
- createdAt
- updatedAt

TenantTheme:
- tenantId
- primaryColor
